    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d440">

                <pb facs="0554" n="446" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg446"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Señor Romero.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-03-31"><hi rendition="#italic">March 31,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to the note of your legation of
                    6th ultimo, submitting certain propositions from the Government of Mexico for
                    the better pursuit of lawless characters on the Bio Grande border, I have the
                    honor to inclose a copy of a letter of the major-general commanding the Army
                    concurring in the propositions mentioned.</p>
                <p>In communicating these views on the 29th instant, the Secretary of War states
                    that the recommendation at the close of Gen. Schofield’s letter herewith, will
                    be carried out.</p>
                <p>Accept, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">W. Q. Gresham.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d440-a1.xml" xpointer="d440-a1"/>
